<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean KFA buys 30,000-35,000T Brazilian soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean KFA buys 30,000-35,000T Brazilian soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Korea Feed Association (KFA) on Thursday bought 30,000 to 35,000 tonnes of soymeal at $276.50 per tonne, C&amp;F, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said the association bought from Toepfer, with the arrival due by October 20 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for August 22-September 10 from South America, they said.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
